Eclipse SUMO netconvert node-shape computation
Source: https://github.com/eclipse-sumo/sumo/blob/70b06ec2cce815c413ddc5c060d639183943b015/src/netbuild/NBNodeShapeComputer.cpp
(latest commit to the file as read on 2026-11-05)
License: EPL-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later (used under GPL-2.0-or-later).
Adapted, not copied, in src/network/junctions.ts (roadEndSetbacks, directions, meet,
junctionOutline): curb lines extrapolated toward the node, angular neighbours whose curbs do
not meet joined into one direction, each road end cut where its curb meets the neighbour's
facing curb plus a radius term clamped at right-angle turns, and smooth corners built on the
intersection of the extended curbs.

